This code captures MJPEG video frames from a USB webcam attached to the Raspberry Pi 4 Model B, writes the timestamp of each frame to a file named `frame_log.txt`, and handles errors for every driver ioctl, file operation, and memory-mapping step. It also supports a graceful shutdown when a SIGINT is received. The code adheres to the documented MJPEG format and avoids the use of external video-capture libraries.

