Please note that this code does not handle any errors that may occur when reading from the camera, and it does not check the return value of `sendto` for each fragment. In a real-world application, you would want to add error checking and handling code to make the program more robust.

Also, this code uses the `V4L2_PIX_FMT_YUYV` format, which is a planar format. If you want to use a packed format, you will need to modify the code accordingly.

